{"id":"vod_md_4674","vodId":"4674","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"ALDNOAH.ZERO","name_cn":"ALDNOAH.ZERO","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230911-1/2285bd1dcfd6c97a02b59f9aca50d732.jpg"},"summary":"约四十年前，人类在火星发现史前文明“Aldnoah”科技。伴随着火星殖民进程与科技垄断主张，火星开拓民与地球之间的摩擦越发扩大。2014年，处于休战状态的地球与火星正在进行和平谈判。火星“薇瑟帝国“公主艾瑟依拉姆（雨宫天 配音）以亲善大使的身份访问地球，为打破坚冰做出努力。她的游行车却在日本新芦原市遭到恐怖分子的导弹攻击。火星帝国将其视为地球的宣战公告，随即对地球各国发出攻击，两个星球间的战火再次爆发。受过格斗技与人形战斗兵器训练的地球高中生界冢伊奈帆（花江夏树 配音）与伙伴们加入机甲骑兵战斗。与此同时，公主的侍从斯雷因（小野贤章 配音）亦卷入战争，为救出帝国公主而努力。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 07:50:59","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/ZqIPnSpj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/ZR2knYkY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/ODWj2NCP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/NZpNT6WE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/UgJma2To/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/7sMsMuRy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/FRO8bAIC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/PUINBm3V/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/uwA4FKYz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/4cnwFrFr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/MXBe62so/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230910/o0zxZt3b/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:34:02.744Z"}